LowResRMX @LOWRESRMX_VERSION@ - Retro Game Creator
https://ret.ro.it/about.html

A fantasy console: write, run and share small games in a BASIC dialect, targeting mobile device.

Create your games and play it on the go using an iPhone or iPad and soon Android (comming this decade).
Retro Game Creator is a virtual game console and a game development environment that include all the tools to start and finish a project.

It include a project manager, a code editor and some tools to edit game assets: sprites, palettes, backgrounds, instruments and musics.

> This is a fork of the excellent fantasy console [LowRes NX by Timo "Inutilis" Kloss](https://lowresnx.inutilis.com).


RUNNING A PROGRAM

  LowResRMX programs/Color Picker.rmx

or start LowResRMX and drag a .rmx file onto the window.
On macOS you can also double-click a .rmx file.


HOT KEYS

  ESC              open / close the Development Menu (quits when -disabledev yes)
  CTRL+R           reload and restart the program
  CTRL+E           eject (reboot the console)
  CTRL+D           toggle debug mode
  CTRL+S           save a 4x screenshot to the Desktop (CTRL+SHIFT+S for 1x)
  CTRL+Z           cycle zoom mode
  CTRL+PLUS/MINUS  volume

Inside the Development Menu the same keys work without CTRL (R, E, D, S, Z, +, -).


SETTINGS FILE

  Linux    ~/.local/share/martin_mauchauffee/LowResRMX/settings.txt
  Windows  %APPDATA%\martin_mauchauffee\LowResRMX\settings.txt
  macOS    ~/Library/Application Support/martin_mauchauffee/LowResRMX/settings.txt


NOTES

macOS: this build is not signed by Apple. The first launch is blocked by
Gatekeeper - right-click LowResRMX.app and choose Open, or run
"xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine /Applications/LowResRMX.app".

Windows: the installer is not signed, so SmartScreen shows a warning -
choose "More info" then "Run anyway".
